{"id": "OR-003-header-value-ctl", "axis": "header-value-validation", "input": "header value containing bare CR, bare LF, or NUL", "verdicts": {"h1": "reject:NUL-and-line-split-on-CR-LF", "h2": "reject:CR-LF-NUL-on-literal-and-dynamic", "h3": "reject:CR-LF-NUL-on-live-literal-path", "yarp": "UNKNOWN:no-committed-C6-snippet"}, "divergence": "No accept-vs-reject on the live paths. H1 ParseHeaders cuts the header block on CR or LF, TryTakeSingleHeader requires a colon, and OnHeader passes checkForNewlineChars false, so GetRequestHeaderString rejects NUL and a value span does not contain the delimiter bytes. H3 literal headers call OnHeader with checkForNewlineChars true, which rejects CR, LF, and NUL. The H3 dynamic branch passes false, but QPackDecoder throws net_http_qpack_no_dynamic_table instead of calling OnDynamicIndexedHeader, and ProcessHeaderValue only calls OnHeader or OnStaticIndexedHeader. H2 literal and dynamic no-static-index calls pass true. YARP is UNKNOWN.", "evidence": {"h1": "evidence/c5/HttpParser`1.decompiled.cs:127-202 | C5:c5-kestrel/decomp/after/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Server.Kestrel.Core.Internal.Http.HttpParser`1.decompiled.cs:127-202 ;; evidence/c5/HttpParser`1.decompiled.cs:318-390 | C5:c5-kestrel/decomp/after/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Server.Kestrel.Core.Internal.Http.HttpParser`1.decompiled.cs:318-390 ;; evidence/c5/Http1ParsingHandler.decompiled.cs:23-32 | C5:c5-kestrel/decomp/after/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Server.Kestrel.Core.Internal.Http.Http1ParsingHandler.decompiled.cs:23-32 ;; evidence/c5/HttpUtilities.decompiled.cs:129-147 | C5:c5-kestrel/decomp/after/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Server.Kestrel.Core.Internal.Infrastructure.HttpUtilities.decompiled.cs:129-147", "h2": "evidence/c7/Http2Connection.decompiled.cs:1216-1232 | C7@434e35b:c7-kestrel-h3/decomp/h2/10.0.13/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Server.Kestrel.Core.Internal.Http2.Http2Connection.decompiled.cs:1216-1232", "h3": "evidence/c7/Http3Stream.decompiled.cs:416-431 | C7@434e35b:c7-kestrel-h3/decomp/h3/10.0.