{"id": "OR-006-trailer-ctl", "axis": "trailer-validation", "input": "trailer value containing CR, LF, or NUL", "verdicts": {"h1": "reject:CR-LF-NUL", "h2": "reject:CR-LF-NUL", "h3": "reject:CR-LF-NUL", "yarp": "UNKNOWN:no-committed-C6-snippet"}, "divergence": "No split. H1 chunked trailers call OnTrailer. H3 switches to trailers on a HEADERS frame after the body and calls the same OnTrailer. OnTrailer decodes the value with checkForNewlineChars true, so CR, LF, and NUL throw. A pseudo-header in H3 trailers also throws. YARP is UNKNOWN.", "evidence": {"h1": "evidence/c5/Http1ParsingHandler.decompiled.cs:23-32 | C5:c5-kestrel/decomp/after/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Server.Kestrel.Core.Internal.Http.Http1ParsingHandler.decompiled.cs:23-32 ;; evidence/c5/HttpProtocol.decompiled.cs:1306-1311 | C5:c5-kestrel/decomp/after/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Server.Kestrel.Core.Internal.Http.HttpProtocol.decompiled.cs:1306-1311 ;; evidence/c5/HttpUtilities.decompiled.cs:129-147 | C5:c5-kestrel/decomp/after/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Server.Kestrel.Core.Internal.Infrastructure.HttpUtilities.decompiled.cs:129-147", "h2": "evidence/c7/Http2Connection.decompiled.cs:1199-1204 | C7@434e35b:c7-kestrel-h3/decomp/h2/10.0.13/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Server.Kestrel.Core.Internal.Http2.Http2Connection.decompiled.cs:1199-1204 ;; evidence/c7/Http2Connection.decompiled.cs:1281-1283 | C7@434e35b:c7-kestrel-h3/decomp/h2/10.0.13/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Server.Kestrel.Core.Internal.Http2.Http2Connection.decompiled.cs:1281-1283 ;; evidence/c7/HttpProtocol.decompiled.cs:1306-1311 | C7@434e35b:c7-kestrel-h3/decomp/shared/10.0.13/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Server.Kestrel.Core.Internal.Http.HttpProtocol.decompiled.cs:1306-1311", "h3": "evidence/c7/Http3Stream.decompiled.cs:399-403 | C7@434e35b:c7-kestrel-h3/decomp/h3/10.0.13/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Server.Kestrel.Core.Internal.Http3.Http3Stream.decompiled.cs:399-403 ;; evidence/c7/Http3Stream.decompiled.cs:472-474 | C7@434e35b:c7-kestrel-h3/decomp/h3/10.0.13/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Server.Kes