{"id": "OR-007-cl-data-reconciliation", "axis": "body-length-source", "input": "Content-Length present and transfer-encoding absent", "verdicts": {"h1": "framing-source:ContentLength", "h2": "framing-source:ContentLength", "h3": "framing-source:ContentLength", "yarp": "UNKNOWN:no-committed-C6-snippet"}, "divergence": "No split. With transfer-encoding absent, H1 returns an Http1ContentLengthMessageBody for a positive length and the reader slices the connection buffer to that remaining length. H3 and H2 set InputRemaining from ContentLength, throw when a DATA payload is longer, and throw when the stream ends with a non-zero remainder. The accepted length is the same header value. YARP is UNKNOWN.", "evidence": {"h1": "evidence/c5/Http1MessageBody.decompiled.cs:153-164 | C5:c5-kestrel/decomp/after/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Server.Kestrel.Core.Internal.Http.Http1MessageBody.decompiled.cs:153-164 ;; evidence/c5/Http1ContentLengthMessageBody.decompiled.cs:186-190 | C5:c5-kestrel/decomp/after/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Server.Kestrel.Core.Internal.Http.Http1ContentLengthMessageBody.decompiled.cs:186-190 ;; evidence/c5/Http1ContentLengthMessageBody.decompiled.cs:256-266 | C5:c5-kestrel/decomp/after/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Server.Kestrel.Core.Internal.Http.Http1ContentLengthMessageBody.decompiled.cs:256-266", "h2": "evidence/c7/Http2Connection.decompiled.cs:983 | C7@434e35b:c7-kestrel-h3/decomp/h2/10.0.13/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Server.Kestrel.Core.Internal.Http2.Http2Connection.decompiled.cs:983 ;; evidence/c7/Http2Stream.decompiled.cs:404-410 | C7@434e35b:c7-kestrel-h3/decomp/h2/10.0.13/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Server.Kestrel.Core.Internal.Http2.Http2Stream.decompiled.cs:404-410 ;; evidence/c7/Http2Stream.decompiled.cs:432-434 | C7@434e35b:c7-kestrel-h3/decomp/h2/10.0.13/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Server.Kestrel.Core.Internal.Http2.Http2Stream.decompiled.cs:432-434", "h3": "evidence/c7/Http3Stream.decompiled.cs:831 | C7@434e35b:c7-kestrel-h3/decomp/h3/10.0.13/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Server.Kestrel.Core