{"id": "OR-009-te-not-chunked", "axis": "body-length-source", "input": "lowercase transfer-encoding whose final coding is not chunked, and no Content-Length", "verdicts": {"h1": "reject:FinalTransferCodingNotChunked", "h2": "accept:stored-transfer-encoding-no-chunked-reader", "h3": "accept:stored-transfer-encoding-no-chunked-reader", "yarp": "UNKNOWN:no-committed-C6-snippet"}, "divergence": "H1 throws FinalTransferCodingNotChunked when HasTransferEncoding is set and the final coding is not chunked. H3 does not treat the name transfer-encoding as connection-specific, stores it, leaves InputRemaining null when Content-Length is absent, and writes DATA without that length check. H2 likewise sets InputRemaining from ContentLength (null here) and does not select a chunked reader; its literal te check is a different header name. H3 accepts a field-set H1 rejects. The H3 path does not forward the request. No C6 snippet shows a downstream H1 hop receiving the preserved header. YARP is UNKNOWN.", "evidence": {"h1": "evidence/c5/Http1MessageBody.decompiled.cs:135-141 | C5:c5-kestrel/decomp/after/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Server.Kestrel.Core.Internal.Http.Http1MessageBody.decompiled.cs:135-141 ;; evidence/c5/HttpHeaders.decompiled.cs:597-641 | C5:c5-kestrel/decomp/after/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Server.Kestrel.Core.Internal.Http.HttpHeaders.decompiled.cs:597-641 ;; evidence/c5/HttpRequestHeaders.decompiled.cs:7904-7916 | C5:c5-kestrel/decomp/after/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Server.Kestrel.Core.Internal.Http.HttpRequestHeaders.decompiled.cs:7904-7916", "h2": "evidence/c7/Http2Connection.decompiled.cs:983 | C7@434e35b:c7-kestrel-h3/decomp/h2/10.0.13/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Server.Kestrel.Core.Internal.Http2.Http2Connection.decompiled.cs:983 ;; evidence/c7/Http2Connection.decompiled.cs:1364-1374 | C7@434e35b:c7-kestrel-h3/decomp/h2/10.0.13/Microsoft.AspNetCore.Server.Kestrel.Core.Internal.Http2.Http2Connection.decompiled.cs:1364-1374 ;; evidence/c7/H2StaticTable.decompiled.cs:173 | C7@434e35b:c7-ke